ly: 굴림체\">』</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">UNOSDP</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">와 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">광주하계유니버시아드 조직위원회에서는 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">27</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">일 예술과 문화를 통한 스포츠의 다양성을 공유하고자</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘Sport meets Art and Culture’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">를 주제로 광주에서</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">『</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">EPICS FORUM 2014</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">를 개최</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">하고</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">국내외 대학생 여러분들의 참신한 시각과 아이디어를 공모</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">포럼 당일 국내외 저명인사와 또래 친구들 앞에서 발표할 수 있는 기회를 제공하고자 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">『</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">EPICS FORUM 2014 PT </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">대회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">를 아래와 같이 개최합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-